.TH TIME 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
time \- returns seconds since the unix epoch and optionally stores the result
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <time.h>
.B time_t time(time_t* result);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns seconds since the Unix epoch and optionally stores the result.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR time (2)
